    "The primary interval loses before execution cost over the full path and in every post-paper confirmation block through May 2026, so spread assumptions do not create the rejection.",
    "P1 is only marginally gross-positive at +$0.1307 with PF 1.0074, then turns negative at observed and stressed cost; two of its three chronological splits and both PRE4/POST4 stressed roles are negative.",
